    "faq": [
      {
        "question": "Does this skill require a Zoho connection?",
        "answer": "Yes. Rube MCP must be connected, and Zoho OAuth must show an active connection before workflows run."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can it create and update CRM records?",
        "answer": "Yes. It can guide supported Zoho tools to create records and update selected fields after lookup."
      },
      {
        "question": "Does it search tool schemas first?",
        "answer": "Yes. The skill instructs the assistant to search current Rube tool schemas before using Zoho actions."
